+                'Flowstead (D103): with no second-liquid outlet, both liquids leave by the liquid outlet, as in a HYSYS
+                'two-phase separator, instead of an error. The stream is flashed downstream (PH), so it keeps both phases.
+                If Not Me.GraphicObject.OutputConnectors(2).IsAttached AndAlso Me.GraphicObject.OutputConnectors(1).IsAttached AndAlso W2 > 0.0# Then
